<title>UK: SBC unit sets 10 billion Greek drachma bond.</title>
<headline>SBC unit sets 10 billion Greek drachma bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBC JERSEY BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN GRD    COUPON     9.50	MATURITY    18.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.125   PAY DATE  S-11.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    100.125   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	EXCHANGE 40 DAYS AFTER PAYMENT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
